---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Moderación" active="moderacion">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 py-4 sm:py-6 w-full space-y-4">
    <header class="glass-panel px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl">
      <span class="text-[12px] font-display font-bold text-galaxy-400 uppercase tracking-widest bg-galaxy-600/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-galaxy-400/30">Solo staff</span>
      <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-display font-extrabold text-white uppercase tracking-wider text-shadow-glow mt-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Moderación</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs mt-0.5">Reportes de la comunidad: revisa, oculta, sanciona o descarta. Cada acción queda en la Auditoría.</p>
    </header>

    <div id="mod-sinsesion" hidden class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-8 text-center text-gray-400 text-sm">Inicia sesión para continuar.</div>
    <div id="mod-denegado" hidden class="glass-panel rounded-2xl p-8 text-center text-sm space-y-1">
      <p class="text-white font-display font-bold uppercase tracking-wider"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Esta página es solo para el staff</p>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-xs">Tu cuenta no tiene permiso para ver los reportes.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="mod-app" hidden class="space-y-4">
      <div id="mod-error" hidden role="alert" class="rounded-xl border border-rose-400/40 bg-rose-500/10 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-rose-200 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
        <i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i><span id="mod-error-txt" class="flex-1 min-w-0"></span>
        <button type="button" id="mod-reintentar" class="btn btn-ghost !min-h-8 !px-3 !text-[12px]">Reintentar</button>
      </div>
      <p id="mod-solo-lectura" hidden class="rounded-xl border border-sky-400/30 bg-sky-500/10 px-4 py-2.5 text-xs text-sky-200"><i class="fa-solid fa-eye mr-1.5"></i>Tu rol puede <b>ver</b> los reportes pero no actuar sobre ellos. Si algo es urgente, avisa a un moderador.</p>

      <section id="mod-marcadores" hidden class="space-y-2" aria-labelledby="h-mod-marc">
        <h2 id="h-mod-marc" class="text-base font-display font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-galaxy-border pb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Marcadores en disputa <b data-cuenta class="text-galaxy-400"></b></h2>
        <div data-lista class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-2"></div>
      </section>

      <section id="mod-hosts" hidden class="space-y-2" aria-labelledby="h-mod-hosts">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 border-b border-galaxy-border pb-2">
          <h2 id="h-mod-hosts" class="text-base font-display font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider flex-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-desktop text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Hosts Phoenix Soda <b data-hp-cuenta class="text-galaxy-400"></b></h2>
          <button type="button" data-hp-filtro="pendientes" aria-pressed="true" class="adv-chip !min-h-8 !px-3 !text-[12px]">Por aprobar</button>
          <button type="button" data-hp-filtro="aprobados" aria-pressed="false" class="adv-chip !min-h-8 !px-3 !text-[12px]">Aprobados</button>
        </div>
        <div data-hp-lista class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-2"></div>
      </section>

      <section id="mod-creadores" hidden class="space-y-2" aria-labelledby="h-mod-cr">
        <h2 id="h-mod-cr" class="text-base font-display font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-galaxy-border pb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-video text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Creadores</h2>
        <div data-cr-lista class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-2"></div>
      </section>

      <section id="mod-privacidad" hidden class="space-y-2" aria-labelledby="h-mod-priv">
        <h2 id="h-mod-priv" class="text-base font-display font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-galaxy-border pb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Solicitudes de privacidad <b data-pv-cuenta class="text-galaxy-400"></b></h2>
        <p class="text-[12px] text-gray-500">Plazo máximo de respuesta: 30 días. Para eliminar una cuenta, hazlo desde Supabase (Authentication → Users) y luego márcala como resuelta.</p>
        <div data-pv-lista class="space-y-2"></div>
      </section>

      <section id="bzs-card" hidden class="space-y-2" aria-labelledby="h-bzs">
        <h2 id="h-bzs" class="text-base font-display font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider border-b border-galaxy-border pb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn text-galaxy-400 mr-2"></i>Aviso global a todos los juegos</h2>
        <textarea id="bzs-texto" rows="2" maxlength="600" class="w-full rounded-lg bg-black/30 border border-white/15 p-2 text-sm text-white" placeholder="Ej.: Mantenimiento a las 22:00"></textarea>
        <button type="button" id="bzs-enviar" class="btn btn-primary"><i class="fa-solid fa-paper-plane"></i> Enviar a todos</button>
      </section>

      <div id="mod-tabs" class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5" role="group" aria-label="Estado de los reportes"></div>
      <section id="mod-lista" class="space-y-3" aria-live="polite"></section>
      <div class="text-center"><button type="button" id="mod-mas" hidden class="btn btn-ghost">Cargar más</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
<script>
  import '../js/pages/moderacion.js';
  import '../js/pages/moderacionPrivacidad.js';
  import '../js/features/buzon.js';
</script>
